== Trivia ==
* {{dlc|rnr+}} Enemies that are [[Freeze|frozen]], actually do release tears. However, since these tears are spawned inside of enemies' ice statues, they deal damage to statues and immediately destroy themselves.
** {{dlc|rnr+}} If enemy had high enough health, statue may be shattered instantly because of that.

